<h2>Source-system contract</h2><p>Use schema version 1, the exact source identifier, the July 2026–June 2030 period and the <code>2030-v1</code> definitions displayed on the public goals section. Each system must explicitly approve publication. The scheduler checks feeds every 15 minutes, independently of email and publishing delivery.</p>
<pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><?=e(json_encode(['schema_version'=>1,'source'=>'goblis_group','period_start'=>'2026-07-01','period_end'=>'2030-06-30','definition_version'=>'2030-v1','approved_for_publication'=>true,'as_of'=>gmdate('Y-m-d\TH:i:s\Z'),'metrics'=>['startups'=>0,'permanent_staff'=>0]],JSON_PRETTY_PRINT|JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES))?></pre>
<p>Optional fields: Ubunifu may also report <code>metrics.ubunifu_permanent_staff</code>. Any source may supply <code>metrics.indirect_beneficiaries</code>, alongside a public <code>beneficiary_basis</code> explanation and <code>beneficiary_deduplicated: true</code>. Indirect counts must exclude direct participants and document evidence of benefit; no automatic household multiplier is used. Missing optional fields leave existing feeds compatible.</p><p>The numbers above are an example, not production results. Other identifiers: <code>ubunifu</code> with <code>social_enterprises</code>; <code>afritrace</code> with <code>market_access</code>; <code>goblis_foundation</code> with its corroborating <code>market_access</code>. Send nonnegative integer aggregates only. Do not send names, identity documents, payroll details or enterprise records. Each source must deduplicate before aggregation. Missing, invalid or older reports do not overwrite the last accepted report.</p>
<p><a href="<?=url('/about#goals-2030')?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review public goals and counting definitions ↗</a></p></main>
